{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_27", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_28", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - A CALL GETS BOOKED", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - A CALL GETS BOOKED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Zapier does the handoff. When a call is booked in Cal.com, the Booking Created Zap creates or updates the contact in GoHighLevel, fills Call\nTime and Call Notes, and adds the call-booked tag. That tag starts everything below and puts the lead in the Call Booked Pipeline.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Zapier does the handoff. When a call is booked in Cal.com, the Booking Created Zap creates or updates the contact in GoHighLevel, fills Call\nTime and Call Notes, and adds the call-booked tag. That tag starts everything below and puts the lead in the Call Booked Pipeline.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_30", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - THE OWNER HEARS FIRST", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - THE OWNER HEARS FIRST", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "You get a text the moment it lands and an email with everything from the booking form, so\nyou walk into the call prepared.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "You get a text the moment it lands and an email with everything from the booking form, so\nyou walk into the call prepared.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_33", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -122, "width": 1048, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -106, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - BEFORE THE CALL", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - BEFORE THE CALL", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -71, "width": 1004, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cal.com already sends the confirmation and the reminders, so nothing here repeats them. One short email asks what they want from the call,\nthen the workflow keeps watch for a cancel. The close-out task keeps cards from sitting in Call Booked; Showed and No Show are the other two\nstages.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cal.com already sends the confirmation and the reminders, so nothing here repeats them. One short email asks what they want from the call,\nthen the workflow keeps watch for a cancel. The close-out task keeps cards from sitting in Call Booked; Showed and No Show are the other two\nstages.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_36", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3290, "y": -106, "width": 1744, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_37", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -90, "width": 1700, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - IF THEY CANCEL", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - IF THEY CANCEL", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_38", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -54, "width": 1700, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A second Zap on Cal.com Booking Cancelled adds call-cancelled. The goal pulls the contact here from wherever they are, the card moves to Cancelled, and they get one easy way to rebook. A reschedule only updates Call Time, so the card\nstays put.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A second Zap on Cal.com Booking Cancelled adds call-cancelled. The goal pulls the contact here from wherever they are, the card moves to Cancelled, and they get one easy way to rebook. A reschedule only updates Call Time, so the card\nstays put.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_39"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 31.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "i